    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## M365 Employee Onboarding Orchestrator\n\n### Overview\nThis agent is invoked by HR when a new employee\nis added in the HRIS system. It orchestrates the full onboarding stack across Notion, Google Drive and Slack.\n\n### Production Failsafes Added:\n- **True Parallel Execution:** All 4 major tasks run independently from the parser.\n- **Continue On Fail:** ALL action and AI nodes output error items to downstream Wait nodes.\n- **Dynamic Validation:** The final summary pulls live IDs, showing ❌ for failed branches.\n- **Global Error Trigger:** Catches unhandled workflow crashes.\n",
        "height": 466,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "437cb166-10b3-4242-abb1-b6027507a880",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -912,
        176
      ]
    },
